1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
We think of China, what comes to mind? Manufacturing, manufacturing, manufacturing.
提到中国，大家会想到什么？制造业，制造业，还是制造业。

2
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
But data actually tells a different story.
但数据实际上讲述了另一个故事。

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:49,000
According to official figures, China's service sector generated some 12 trillion US dollars in added value last year,
根据官方数据，去年中国服务业创造了约12万亿美元的增加值，

4
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
accounting for some 60% of China's GDP.
占中国国内生产总值的约60%。

5
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000
With services now forming the backbone of the economy, efforts are underway to foster higher quality,
随着服务业成为经济的支柱，各方正在努力培育更高质量、

6
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
more diverse and more accessible consumer services.
更多样化且更易获取的消费服务。

7
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:13,000
Now, the sector is projected to exceed 15 trillion US dollars by 2030.
预计该行业到2030年将超过15万亿美元。

8
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,000
What new consumption trends and scenarios will this transformation create?
这种转型将带来哪些新的消费趋势和场景？

9
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:23,000
How will technology reshape the service industry?
技术将如何重塑服务业？

10
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,000
And what opportunities will it open up for international businesses and consumers?
它将为国际企业和消费者带来哪些机遇？

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Welcome to this special edition of our series on China's service sector.
欢迎收看我们关于中国服务业系列的特别节目。

12
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
I'm Lixin, coming to you from the heart of Beijing.
我是刘欣，正在北京为您报道。

13
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:43,000
Our case in point today is digital mapping in China.
我们今天的案例是中国数字地图。

14
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:53,000
I'm visiting a Chinese company that's using AI technology to enhance services for both domestic and international users.
我正在访问一家中国公司，该公司利用人工智能技术提升为国内外用户提供的服务。

15
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
I'll first sit down with a company representative, then I'll try it out with an American counterpart
我将先与公司代表进行访谈，然后与一位美国同行一起体验，

16
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,000
before sitting down with an industry expert to bring you the full picture.
之后再与行业专家对谈，为您呈现全貌。

17
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:21,000
I'm here at the AMAP headquarters in Beijing and my guest is Mr. Li Gang, Vice President for Content Ecosystem of AMAP.
我现在在北京的高德地图总部，我的嘉宾是高德地图内容生态副总裁李刚先生。

18
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Mr. Li, welcome to the point.
李先生，欢迎来到《锐评》。

19
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,500
Nice to meet you.
很高兴见到你。

20
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,500
Nice to meet you.
很高兴见到你。

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000
It's our pleasure to and thank you for hosting us.
很荣幸能来到这里，感谢你们的邀请。

22
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Now, AMAP is a map.
现在，高德地图是一款地图应用。

23
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:41,000
You didn't stop there and you continue to add new features, the latest two for instance, street stars and flying street view.
你们并没有止步于此，而是不断添加新功能，比如最近推出的两个功能：街景明星和飞行街景。

24
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Help us understand exactly what these features are exactly and how are they changing people's way of using maps?
请帮我们确切地了解这些功能具体是什么，以及它们如何改变人们使用地图的方式？

25
00:02:51,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Yeah, AMAP is the biggest map in China and there are 10 millions people on our map every day.
是的，高德地图是中国最大的地图应用，每天有1000万人在使用我们的地图。

26
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:10,000
They are navigating and searching places and maybe also giving reviews and a lot of behaviors.
他们在进行导航、搜索地点，可能还会写评论，并进行许多其他操作。

27
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:17,000
Last year, on September 10th, we have launched a new product named Street Stars.
去年9月10日，我们推出了一款名为“街景明星”的新产品。

28
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:25,000
We can help people to find the best restaurant just on the authentic behaviors of the people.
我们可以根据人们的真实行为，帮助他们找到最好的餐厅。

29
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:29,000
We call that 1 billion people voting with their feet.
我们称之为“十亿人用脚投票”。

30
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:37,000
There are a lot of restaurants that have established very long time, especially for Beijing, Nanjing and Guangzhou.
有很多餐厅已经经营了很长时间，尤其是在北京、南京和广州。

31
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:46,000
They are very good taste but they know very few about how to marketing, especially how to marketing on the internet.
它们味道很好，但非常不了解如何做营销，尤其是在互联网上如何做营销。

32
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:58,000
So you can find them on Street Stars and also I need to mention you can find very cozy Pop and Mom restaurant.
所以你可以在“街景明星”上找到它们，另外我需要提一下，你也能找到非常温馨的夫妻小店。

33
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:01,000
What about flying street view?
那“飞行街景”呢？

34
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:18,000
We launched that on January this year and when we launched our Street Stars, we can see 10 millions people use our Street Stars.
我们今年一月推出了它，当我们推出“街景明星”时，我们看到有1000万人在使用我们的“街景明星”。

35
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:29,000
After that, we see that before you go to a restaurant or before you go to a very famous hotel,
在那之后，我们发现，在你去一家餐厅或去一家非常著名的酒店之前，

36
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:37,000
