你想在到达之前看看那个地方长什么样。

37
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:42,000
Instead of just a picture, instead of just a rating, you want to see in 3D.
不仅仅是看一张照片，不仅仅是看一个评分，你想以3D的方式看到它。

38
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:52,000
3D image, so we bring flying street views to help people to see what the place exactly like before they arrive there.
3D图像，所以我们带来了“飞行街景”，帮助人们在到达之前确切地看到那个地方是什么样子的。

39
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,000
That's very good technology.
这项技术非常好。

40
00:04:54,000 --> 00:05:00,000
How many people are using these features? What's the feedback?
有多少人正在使用这些功能？反馈如何？

41
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:08,000
Everyday millions of people use that and a lot of places you can see the flying street views.
每天有数百万人使用它，在很多地方都能看到飞行街景。

42
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:19,000
We help people before they arrive, they can see what exactly look like and the places around your destination.
我们在人们到达之前提供帮助，让他们能看到目的地具体长什么样，以及周边的环境。

43
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:22,000
So help millions of people everyday.
因此，我们每天帮助数百万人。

44
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:31,000
What about English language version? I understand that AMAP is the only Chinese-made map that offers this service.
那英文版呢？我了解到高德地图是唯一提供此服务的中国自研地图。

45
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:35,000
