他们可以使用高德地图进行搜索和导航，还可以打车。

50
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:18,000
And also, I need to say, we can cover around the world more than 200 countries with our AMAP.
此外，我要说的是，我们的高德地图可以覆盖全球200多个国家。

51
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:26,000
We go to the United States or Japan or Thailand and you can also use our AMAP to search and navigation.
当你去美国、日本或泰国时，你也可以使用我们的高德地图进行搜索和导航。

52
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:42,000
So it's a world map. How accurate, I mean people would want to ask that, how reliable, for instance, will the signal always be there if you go into some remote places in the world?
所以它是一张世界地图。关于准确性，我想人们会问，它有多可靠？例如，如果你去世界上一些偏远的地方，信号总是有的吗？

53
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:48,000
For instance, if you're in the mountains or if you're in the jungle, can you still use your map? This is one thing.
例如，如果你在山里或在丛林中，你还能使用你的地图吗？这是其中一点。

54
00:06:48,000 --> 00:07:00,000
And secondly, how accurate will it be? I mean you have many other apps but will AMAP tell you exactly where you are and show you exactly where you want to go?
其次，它的准确性如何？我是说，你有许多其他应用，但高德地图会准确地告诉你你在哪里，并显示你想去的地方吗？

55
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:12,000
Yeah. First, I need to say, we are very lucky. We are a company of China because in China we use Beidou system.
是的。首先，我需要说，我们很幸运。我们是一家中国公司，因为在中国我们使用北斗系统。

56
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:17,000
The Chinese? It's very, very powerful, more powerful than GPS, obviously.
中国的？它非常、非常强大，显然比GPS更强大。

57
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:26,000
So you can use the satellite to get your location and also communicate.
所以你可以使用卫星获取你的位置，也可以进行通信。

58
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,000
So anywhere around the world?
在世界的任何地方？

59
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:38,000
Anywhere around the world. And especially when you can't get a signal off your phone, you still can communicate with the satellite.
在世界的任何地方。特别是当你的手机没有信号时，你仍然可以通过卫星进行通信。

60
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:41,000
So you can also use it.
所以你也可以使用它。

61
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,500
Have you tested it?
你们测试过了吗？

62
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Yeah, that's a very special feature of our map.
是的，这是我们地图的一个非常特别的功能。

63
00:07:46,000 --> 00:08:01,000
Okay. What opportunities then will these features of the English version bring to foreign visitors who come to China, foreign business people or foreign students who are studying in China?
好的。那么，这些英文版的功能会给来中国的外国游客、外国商人或在中国学习的外国学生带来哪些机会呢？

64
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,000
You mean benefit?
你是说好处吗？

65
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:08,000
Yeah. What kind of opportunities will it bring them? How will they benefit them?
对。它会给他们带来什么样的机会？他们能从中获得什么好处？

66
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:23,000
Okay. In MAP-Penin, for the foreign visitors, they will have a very short cycle because eventually they need to search a place through MAP.
好的。在MAP-Penin中，对于外国游客来说，他们的使用周期会非常短，因为他们最终需要通过地图来搜索地点。

67
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:32,000
They always use a map and then navigation and they can take a taxi before.
他们以前总是使用地图和导航，然后可以打车。

68
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:44,000
But for now, they can also make decisions on our map, use the street stars and make the decision and have the very, very local best dishes.
但现在，他们也可以在我们的地图上做出决策，使用街景功能，做出选择，并找到非常地道的当地美食。

69
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:49,000
Then they can go to place with our navigation and also take a taxi.
然后他们可以用我们的导航去那个地方，也可以打车。

70
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,000
That's a very short cycle.
这是一个非常短的周期。

71
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,000
For the first, for the second, we also launch...
首先，其次，我们还推出了……

72
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:58,000
So basically it's one app with many different functions.
所以基本上，它是一个具有多种不同功能的应用程序。

73
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:11,000
When you go out and find some place, you can in one app or in one and make all the decisions and make all the go away behavior on our map.
当你外出寻找某个地方时，你可以在一个应用程序中做出所有决策，并在我们的地图上完成所有出行行为。

74
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,500
I see.
我明白了。

75
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,500
The second point.
第二点。

76
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,500
The second point.
第二点。

77
